[{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050100_07_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050100_07_0010","text":"……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050100_07_0020","text":"（好，今天的任务就全部完成了）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050100_07_0030","text":"（……说起来，\n　大家是不是都已经回去了？）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050100_07_0040","text":"去看看吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050100_07_0050","text":"大家，辛苦了\n大概还要多久回——"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050100_07_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050100_07_0060","text":"爱依酱\n最后那一下，稍微有点偏了哦"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050100_07_0070","text":"抱歉，我也注意到了\n那里，让我再来一遍"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050100_07_0002","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050100_07_0080","text":"冬优子也提一个可以吗？\n────朝日"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050100_07_0090","text":"是的说"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050100_07_0100","text":"开头那里，能往左挪半步吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050100_07_0110","text":"那样的话从观众席看过来\n整体构图会更漂亮"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050100_07_0120","text":"……\n知道了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050100_07_0003","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050100_07_0130","text":"那这样吧\n干脆从头到尾过一遍吧！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050100_07_0140","text":"中间附近也有我在意的地方\n可以吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050100_07_0150","text":"好啊／嗯"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050100_07_0160","text":"准备走了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050100_07_0170","text":"３、２、１──"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050100_07_0180","text":"……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050100_07_0190","text":"（哈哈，看来还要一会儿）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050100_07_0200","text":"（慰问品慰问品……好）"}]
